IdP's **SAML metadata XML** into the Mistral SSO configuration modal and click **Enable SSO** [3].\n\n### Summary Table:\n| Mechanism                     | Automatic Joining | Passwordless Sign-In | Plan Requirement       | Verified Domain Required |\n|-------------------------------|-------------------|-----------------------|-------------------------|---------------------------|\n| Email Domain Auth            | ✅ Yes             | ❌ No (credentials needed) | None                    | ✅ Yes                    |\n| SAML SSO                     | ✅ Yes             | ✅ Yes                  | Enterprise              | ✅ Yes                    |\n\nFor **both automatic joining and passwordless sign-in**, **SAML SSO (Enterprise plan)** is the only supported mechanism [1][5].",
